# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): intervals in each Tuning's own terms (ledger 3a, Evan 2026-11-08):
# steps on the equal ones ("12\19"), ratios on the rest ("3/2"). Drone I near D3, drone II near A3, each landed on
# the Tuning's notes (a click up and back); partners +5th and +M3 (par3, par24); Shift (par80) so many notes up.
# On 19-tone (par110 2), Harmonics (6), Harrison (8): Pitch, Partner, Pitch moves. Not a test of its own.
